# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configurable parameters {#configurable-parameters}"
msgstr "Konfigurierbare Parameter {#configurable-parameters}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "QCSC-Prefect keeps each kind of setting in its own place, as in the following table.\n"
msgstr "QCSC-Prefect hält jede Art von Einstellung an einem eigenen Ort, wie in der folgenden Tabelle.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Kind | Examples | Changes | Where it lives |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| Run parameters | Molecule, shots, subspace dimension | Every run | The Prefect Cloud run form, grouped by stage |\n"
"| Blocks | Partition, walltime, threads, executable paths, QPU resource | Per cluster | Prefect blocks, created one time |\n"
"| Credentials | Prefect API key, IBM Quantum API key | Rarely | The Prefect Cloud login on the workflow host, and QRMI (`qcsc-qrmi login`) on the cluster, both set up in the setup guide |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Art | Beispiele | Ändert sich | Wo sie liegt |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| Ausführungsparameter | Molekül, Shots, Unterraumdimension | Bei jedem Lauf | Das Prefect-Cloud-Ausführungsformular, nach Stufe gruppiert |\n"
"| Blocks | Partition, Walltime, Threads, Pfade der ausführbaren Dateien, QPU-Ressource | Pro Cluster | Prefect-Blocks, einmalig erstellt |\n"
"| Zugangsdaten | Prefect-API-Schlüssel, IBM-Quantum-API-Schlüssel | Selten | Der Prefect-Cloud-Login auf dem Workflow-Host und QRMI (`qcsc-qrmi login`) auf dem Cluster, beide in der Einrichtungsanleitung eingerichtet |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The blocks describe each job in the three layers of the following table.\n"
msgstr "Die Blocks beschreiben jeden Job in den drei Schichten der folgenden Tabelle.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Block | Specifies | Contents |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `CommandBlock` | What runs | The executable and its default arguments |\n"
"| `ExecutionProfileBlock` | How it runs | Nodes, threads, walltime, launcher, modules, and environment |\n"
"| `HPCProfileBlock` | Where it runs | Scheduler, partition, account, and the path of each executable on that system |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Block | Legt fest | Inhalt |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `CommandBlock` | Was läuft | Die ausführbare Datei und ihre Standardargumente |\n"
"| `ExecutionProfileBlock` | Wie es läuft | Knoten, Threads, Walltime, Launcher, Module und Umgebung |\n"
"| `HPCProfileBlock` | Wo es läuft | Scheduler, Partition, Account und der Pfad jeder ausführbaren Datei auf diesem System |\n"

